=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Server</em> or <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Proxy</em>, plus <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Username</em> and <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Password</em>). In case of issues with setup on the deskphone, Hard Reset of the hardware phone may help.<br><br></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">(Optional) <span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Outbound Test Call</strong></span> \u2013 Dial the on-screen number; you\u2019ll hear \u201cThis is a test call\u201d three times if successful.<br><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155050965694/original/t0shULddlPVX-g_KSf6KuIlg8R590IhKfQ236f.png?1754407351\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155050965694\"><br></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">(Optional) <span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Inbound Test Call</strong></span> \u2013 Click the button; your phone should ring. Answer and hang up to confirm audio.</