ges</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://gohighlevelassist.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/155000003992?portalId=48000045315#Enrollment-History---UI/UX-Changes\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); cursor: pointer;\">Enrollment History - UI/UX Changes</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://gohighlevelassist.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/155000003992?portalId=48000045315#Highlight-Contact-Path\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); cursor: pointer;\">Highlight Contact Path</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://gohighlevelassist.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/155000003992?portalId=48000045315#Go-To-Action-Button\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); cursor: pointer;\">Go To Action Button</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://gohighlevelassist.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/155000003992?portalId=48000045315#Date-and-Time-Enhancements\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); cursor: pointer;\">Date and Time Enhancements</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://gohighlevelassist.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/155000003992?portalId=48000045315#Changes-in-Contact-History\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); cursor: pointer;\">Changes in Con