box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1715187675543\" data-identifyelement=\"284\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">3000 daily sending limit.**&nbsp;</span><span class=\"tdfocus-1715187676708\" data-identifyelement=\"285\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Only permitted one number.&nbsp;</span><span class=\"tdfocus-1715187677967\" data-identifyelement=\"286\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Cannot use <a class=\"tdfocus-1715187683172\" data-identifyelement=\"743\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/support/solutions/articles/48001231665-why-are-my-calls-marked-as-spam-and-how-can-i-avoid-it-lc-phone-#How-to-Apply-for-SHAKEN/STIR\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"155000006427-why-are-my-calls-marked-as-spam-and-how-can-i-avoid-it-.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SHAKEN/STIR or CNAM.&nbsp;</a></span></span></span></p></td><td class=\"tdfocus-1715099799109\" data-identifyelement=\"744\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 4px; min-wid"}, {"slug": "155000000766", "title": "A2P 10DLC Brand Approval Best Practices", "folder": "LeadConnector Phone", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043010465/original/Z6Q2J9YZrwMAVtt3yVAMakwbLs4zEz6R0w4d4b.png?1741676667", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043010464/original/IVYbQmz6QLRMeXZ168t8m1VTUgc-6Xa96Qe16c.png?1741676666"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"tdfocus-1689854126984\" data-identifyelement=\"998\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">When you register your A2P Brand with your Business Profile, LC Phone will submit your business information to The Campaign Registry for review, determining your eligibility and throughput for your messaging Campaigns. This article summarizes how Brand approval works and our best practices to ensure your Brand is approved.</span></p><h4 class=\"fd-toc\" data-identifyelement=\"501\" id=\"Covererd-in-this-Article:\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" data-identifyelement=\"502\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1690380982340\" data-identifyelement=\"503\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"504\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Covered in this Article:</span></strong></span></h4><p data-identifyelement=\"505\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"506\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"507\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"508\" href=\"#How-Brand-Approval-Works\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"509\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">How Brand Approval Works</span></a></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"510\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"511\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"514\" href=\"#Guidance-for-companies-in-Canada-1\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Guidance for companies in Canada</a></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"515\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"516\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"519\" href=\"#Guidance-for-companies-in-the-rest-of-the-world-2\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Guidance for companies in the rest of the world</a></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"520\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"521\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"524\" href=\"#Common-customer-errors-for-EIN/Tax-ID\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Common customer errors for EIN/Tax ID</a></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"525\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"526\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"529\" href=\"#Check-Your-Business-Address\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Check Your Business Address</a></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"530\" style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"532\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"533\" href=\"#Frequently-Asked-Questions\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></span></span></p><h4 data-identifyelement=\"534\" id=\"Guidance-for-companies-in-Canada\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"535\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/a/solutions/articles/155000000508/edit?portalId=48000045315#Guidance-for-companies-in-Canada\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); user-select: auto; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" data-identifyelement=\"536\"></a></span></span></h4><hr data-identifyelement=\"1005\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; user-select: none; clear: both; break-after: page; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1689854540112\" data-identifyelement=\"1006\" id=\"How-Brand-Approval-Works\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1007\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">How Brand Approval Works</strong></span></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1689854397840\" data-identifyelement=\"1008\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">The approval process starts with a primary vetting of your brand completed by The Campaign Registry. As part of the approval process, LC Phone will automatically submit your brand for<span class=\"tdfocus-1689854211082\" data-identifyelement=\"1009\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"tdfocus-1689854231150\" data-identifyelement=\"1011\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"537\" href=\"155000000859-a2p-10dlc-campaign-vetting-changes-january-2023.html\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Secondary Vetting</a></span><span class=\"tdfocus-1689854354727\" data-identifyelement=\"1012\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">,</span> an additional review process that can lead to increased throughput and messaging limits. Once that vetting is completed, you will receive a Trust Score that determines your long code messaging throughput to US networks and daily message limits to T-Mobile as described in<span class=\"tdfocus-1689854354727\" data-identifyelement=\"1012\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"tdfocus-1689854391048\" data-identifyelement=\"1014\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a href=\"155000004617.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" target=\"_blank\">Message throughput MPS and Trust Scores for A2P 10DLC in the US</a></span><span class=\"tdfocus-1689854564104\" data-identifyelement=\"1015\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">.&nbsp;</span>For a full walkthrough of the Brand registration process, please see our<span class=\"tdfocus-1689854564104\" data-identifyelement=\"1015\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1016\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span><a data-identifyelement=\"9\" href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/support/solutions/articles/48001238163-what-is-a2p-10dlc-\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(241, 46, 69); user-select: auto; cursor: pointer; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></a><a data-identifyelement=\"539\" href=\"155000000756-what-is-a2p-10dlc-.html\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">A2P 10DLC Onboarding Guide.</a><span data-identifyelement=\"1018\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1689854528849\" data-identifyelement=\"1019\" id=\"How-To-Maximize-Your-Trust-Score\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1020\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1689854554488\" data-identifyelement=\"1021\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">How To Maximize Your Trust Score</strong></span></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1022\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">To ensure your Brand is approved and you receive the most accurate Trust Score, you must submit your business data properly. Below are some best practices to follow, along with frequently asked questions regarding Brand registration.</span></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"1023\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Use-a-valid-EIN-for-US-based-companies-\u2013-not-a-DUNS-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1024\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1025\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Use a valid EIN for US-based companies \u2013 not a DUNS number</strong></span></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1026\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">The provided EIN and Legal Company Name must match business registration sources for private and public for-profit companies. Please ensure:&nbsp;</span></p><ul class=\"tdfocus-1689855604848\" data-identifyelement=\"1027\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"1028\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">For Standard A2P 10DLC brand registration, customers with a US presence must use an EIN.</span></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1689854627455\" data-identifyelement=\"1029\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">A DUNS number is unacceptable for US companies creating Standard A2P Brand registrations. A DUNS number should only be used in Business Profile creation if you do not want to use US A2P messaging and only want to use Stir/Shaken for Voice.</span></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1689854687368\" data-identifyelement=\"1030\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">For Non-Profit and Political Organizations, the EIN has to match the Legal Company Name available in the Tax-Exempt Organizations or Registered Political Organizations list. Learn more in<strong data-identifyelement=\"540\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"541\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(184, 49, 47); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-identifyelement=\"1031\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"542\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"543\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(184, 49, 47); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1032\" href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/4405850570267-Nonprofit-and-Government-Guide-to-A2P-10DLC-Text-Messaging\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(184, 49, 47); user-select: auto; cursor: pointer; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Nonprofit and Government Guide to A2P 10DLC Text Messaging</a>.</span></strong></span></span></li></ul><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1031\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"542\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"543\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(184, 49, 47); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></strong></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"570\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"571\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Enter your Legal Company Name exactly as registered with the IRS</strong></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"572\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">If you\u2019re registering a US entity, please enter the exact Legal Company Name as registered with the IRS, which can be found on the CP 575 EIN Confirmation Letter. An exact match between the Legal Company Name and the EIN as displayed on CP 575 is required for the Brand to be successfully registered. Please do not use the Legal Company Name found on the W2 or W9 forms as they may be different from what you have on the CP 575 notice.&nbsp;</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"573\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"574\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"575\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"576\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"577\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">If you do not have access to your company's CP 575 notice then contact your company's accountant or financing office and ask for it. &nbsp;If the CP 575 notice has been misplaced, you may request a 147c letter from the IRS and use the information there for registration.</span></span></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1689854692069\" data-identifyelement=\"1034\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-find-your-EIN-(for-US-companies)\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"996\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1689855514807\" data-identifyelement=\"1035\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">How to find your EIN (for US companies)</strong><strong data-identifyelement=\"1036\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1037\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></strong></span></h3><ul class=\"tdfocus-1689855615686\" data-identifyelement=\"1038\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 17px; list-style: inside disc; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1689854701352\" data-identifyelement=\"1039\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">If your company is publicly traded and registered with the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC), you can use the<span data-identifyelement=\"1040\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span><a data-identifyelement=\"1041\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/searchedgar/companysearch.html\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(241, 46, 69); user-select: auto; cursor: pointer; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1689854671752\" data-identifyelement=\"1042\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">SEC's EDGAR system</span></a><span class=\"tdfocus-1689854695873\" data-identifyelement=\"1043\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;for free to look up your EIN.</span></span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"1044\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Contact your company's accountant or financing office and ask for the EIN.</span></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1689855703633\" data-identifyelement=\"1046\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Find your company\u2019s W2 form or any local or federal tax filings that may be online.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" data-identifyelement=\"544\"><br data-identifyelement=\"998\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></li></ul><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1689854717351\" data-identifyelement=\"1048\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Use-a-Valid-Tax-ID-for-companies-based-outside-of-the-U.S.\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1689855628115\" data-identifyelement=\"1049\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Use a Valid Tax ID for companies based outside of the U.S.</strong></span></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1050\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">The provided EIN and Legal Company Name has to match registration sources for private and public profit companies. Please ensure:</span></p><ul class=\"tdfocus-1689855598535\" data-identifyelement=\"1051\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1689854730399\" data-identifyelement=\"1052\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">ALL customers creating a Business Profile must provide a valid Tax ID.&nbsp;</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"1053\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">A Tax ID from their country is required for Standard A2P 10DLC brand registration or customers with an International presence.</span></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1689855693701\" data-identifyelement=\"1054\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">For Businesses outside US /Canada there may be a requirement for additional vetting to verify their brand successfully.&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1689854726495\" data-identifyelement=\"1055\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">In such cases, they will no longer be able to register as Low volume standards.</span></li></ul><hr data-identifyelement=\"1056\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; user-select: none; clear: both; break-after: page; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1689854833768\" data-identifyelement=\"1057\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Guidance-for-companies-in-Canada-1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1058\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Guidance for companies in Canada</strong></span></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"1059\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"999\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1689855685674\" data-identifyelement=\"1060\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Please Note:</strong></span></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1689854073530\" data-identifyelement=\"1061\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 12px 16px; display: block; cursor: pointer; word-break: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(232, 111, 37); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">On July 27th, for companies in Canada, we will switch to ONLY accepting the Business Number (BN) rather than the Corporation/Incorporation/Registry ID numbers for Canadian Brand Registration. Until that time we will continue to ONLY accept the Corporation/Incorporation/Registry ID numbers.<br data-identifyelement=\"1062\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1063\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">We will only accept the first 9 numeric digits of the BN (BN-9). Here is an example of the format of a BN where the bolded part is the part we will collect in the Canadian Brand.<br data-identifyelement=\"1064\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1065\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Tax/Corporation ID field: 123456789RT0001</span></pre><p data-identifyelement=\"1066\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1067\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1068\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Enter your Provincial Corporation Number as your Business Registration Number.</span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1689854853553\" data-identifyelement=\"1069\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">For example:</span></p><ul class=\"tdfocus-1689854874095\" data-identifyelement=\"1070\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"1071\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Alberta Corporation Number</span></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1689854866896\" data-identifyelement=\"1072\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Ontario Corporation Number (make sure you enter only the numbers after the first two leading zeros)</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"1073\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">British Columbia Corporation Number (make sure the BC prefix is part of the number)</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"1074\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Saskatchewan Corporation Number</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"1075\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Nova Scotia Corporation Number</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"1076\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Quebec Corporation Number</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"1077\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Manitoba Corporation Number</span></li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"1078\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">If this does not work for you, alternatively, you may use your federally-issued Canada Corporation Number.</span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1689854886897\" data-identifyelement=\"1079\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Until July 27th, please do NOT enter your business number or federal tax ID number, as that is not readily cross-referenced. Please ensure your legal company name is properly spelled and consistent with your corporation registration. The address you enter should also match the address you registered with Corporations Canada.</span></p><hr data-identifyelement=\"1080\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; user-select: none; clear: both; break-after: page; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><h2 data-identifyelement=\"1081\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Guidance-for-companies-in-the-rest-of-the-world-2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1689854906439\" data-identifyelement=\"1082\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Guidance for companies in the rest of the world</strong></span></h2><ul data-identifyelement=\"1000\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1689854913494\" data-identifyelement=\"1083\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">European companies should use the <a data-identifyelement=\"1084\" href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/vies/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(241, 46, 69); user-select: auto; cursor: pointer; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1689854884495\" data-identifyelement=\"1085\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">VIES VAT number validation</span></a><span class=\"tdfocus-1689854936262\" data-identifyelement=\"1086\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span>lookup to look up their brand information before submission.</span></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1689854924401\" data-identifyelement=\"1087\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Companies in Australia should use their Australian Business Number (ABN) and use the <a class=\"tdfocus-1689854920511\" data-identifyelement=\"1088\" href=\"https://abr.business.gov.au/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(241, 46, 69); user-select: auto; cursor: pointer; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1089\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">official ABN Lookup tool</span></a><span data-identifyelement=\"1090\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span>to look up the information.</span></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1689854954272\" data-identifyelement=\"1091\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Companies in New Zealand should use New Zealand Business Number (NZBN) and use the<span class=\"tdfocus-1689854954591\" data-identifyelement=\"1092\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;<a class=\"tdfocus-1689854960672\" data-identifyelement=\"1093\" href=\"https://www.nzbn.govt.nz/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(241, 46, 69); user-select: auto; cursor: pointer; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1094\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">official NZBN lookup tool</span></a>&nbsp;</span>to look up the information.</span></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1689854975702\" data-identifyelement=\"1095\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: