 overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">It is entering a number in the EIN or Tax ID field that is invalid for the EIN or home country company ID number.</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"1107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">We provide a DUNS number instead of an EIN for a US-based company.</span></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1689855077206\" data-identifyelement=\"1108\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">You are using SSN to register your brand. If you used your SSN to file your taxes, you are a sole proprietor and should<span class=\"tdfocus-1689855097727\" data-identifyelement=\"1109\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;await further guidance from LC Phone&nbsp;</span>on registering your brand.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" data-identifyelement=\"545\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1002\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></li></ul><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1689855180160\" data-identifyelement=\"1110\" id=\"Further-recommendations:-3\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1111\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&q